"</p>\n"
"<p>Use 'Setting' -> 'Configure&nbsp;showimg' -> 'Plugins' to choose plugins you "
"want to enable.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You can see screenshots at the <a "
"href=\"http://digikam.sourceforge.net/plugins.html\">digikam plugins page</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"

